# Large-asset policy (see assets-source/case-404/README.md):
# Original/master GLBs are large (tens of MB each) and are not committed.
# Directory structure + docs (.gitkeep, README, inventory, credits) stay
# tracked so the pipeline layout survives. Approved production assets in
# public/models/case-404/ ARE committed — they're required for deployment.
assets-source/**/*.glb
assets-source/**/*.gltf
assets-source/**/*.fbx
assets-source/**/*.blend
assets-source/**/*.bin
